@startuml SD-09
skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam defaultFontName Arial
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam ArrowColor #263E35
skinparam LineColor #263E35
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #F1F4EE
skinparam NoteBorderColor #81947D
skinparam SequenceGroupBackgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam SequenceGroupBodyBackgroundColor transparent
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center

title SD-09 / UC-09 - Summarise completed reservations
footer AI-assisted review draft | 2026-11-02
actor Staff as actor
participant "BookBridge" as system
autonumber
actor -> system: Request completed-reservation summary
alt missing or non-staff identity
system --> actor: Reject access; no changes
else staff identity
note right of system
Select Completed only. completedCopies =
sum(quantity); completedAmount = sum(quantity
x savedUnitPrice).
end note
alt completed records exist
system --> actor: Show completed copies and amount to two decimal places
else no completed records
system --> actor: Show completed copies 0 and amount 0.00
else records cannot be read
system --> actor: Show error; do not show misleading zero or partial totals
end
end
note right of system
Exclude Pending collection and Cancelled. Use
saved prices, not catalogue prices. Totals
cover BookBridge records, not verified
payment revenue.
end note
@enduml
